) VALUES (
    'women-in-winter-sports-history',
    '{"en": "Women in Winter Sports: Pioneers Who Changed the Game", "de": "Frauen im Wintersport: Pionierinnen, die das Spiel veränderten", "fr": "Les femmes dans les sports d''hiver : Pionnières qui ont changé la donne", "it": "Le donne negli sport invernali: Pioniere che hanno cambiato il gioco", "es": "Mujeres en los deportes de invierno: Pioneras que cambiaron el juego", "pt": "Mulheres nos esportes de inverno: Pioneiras que mudaram o jogo", "nl": "Vrouwen in de wintersport: Pioniers die het spel veranderden", "ar": "النساء في الرياضات الشتوية: رائدات غيرن اللعبة", "ja": "ウィンタースポーツの女性たち：ゲームを変えたパイオニア", "zh": "Dongji Yundong Zhong de Nvxing: Gaibian Bisai de Xianqu Zhe", "ko": "동계 스포츠의 여성들: 게임을 바꾼 선구자들"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "From being banned from competitions to dominating headlines, women have fought for their place in winter sports. Their journey is one of perseverance against discrimination.", "de": "Vom Wettbewerbsverbot bis zur Schlagzeilendominanz haben Frauen für ihren Platz im Wintersport gekämpft.", "fr": "De l''interdiction des compétitions à la domination des manchettes, les femmes ont lutté pour leur place dans les sports d''hiver.", "it": "Dal divieto di competere al dominio dei titoli, le donne hanno lottato per il loro posto negli sport invernali.", "es": "Desde estar prohibidas en competiciones hasta dominar los titulares, las mujeres han luchado por su lugar en los deportes de invierno.", "pt": "De serem proibidas de competições a dominarem manchetes, as mulheres lutaram por seu lugar nos esportes de inverno.", "nl": "Van verboden wedstrijden tot het domineren van koppen, vrouwen hebben gevochten voor hun plaats in de wintersport.", "ar": "من الحظر من المسابقات إلى السيطرة على العناوين الرئيسية، ناضلت النساء من أجل مكانهن في الرياضات الشتوية", "ja": "競技への参加禁止から見出しを飾るまで、女性はウィンタースポーツでの地位を勝ち取るために戦ってきました。", "zh": "Cong bei jinzhi canjia bisai dao zhuzai toutiao, nvxing wei tamen zai dongji yundong zhong de weizhi er fendou.", "ko": "대회 금지에서 헤드라인 지배까지, 여성들은 동계 스포츠에서 자신의 자리를 위해 싸워왔습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>The history of women in winter sports is a story of determination against discrimination. For decades, women were told certain sports were too dangerous, too difficult, or simply inappropriate for them. One by one, they proved the skeptics wrong.</p><h2>Early Pioneers</h2><p>In the early 1900s, women who wanted to ski had to fight for the privilege. Skiing was considered unfeminine, and competitive skiing was thought dangerous for women''s health. Despite these barriers, determined women found ways to ski.</p><p>The 1924 Winter Games included figure skating for women, but other sports remained closed. Women''s alpine skiing didn''t appear until 1936, with only a combined event.</p><h2>Breaking the Speed Barrier</h2><p>Alpine skiing pioneers like Swiss racer Vreni Schneider and Austrian Annemarie Moser-Pröll dominated their eras, proving women could race at the highest levels. Their success helped expand women''s alpine programs.</p><p>Downhill racing was long considered too dangerous for women. When women finally competed at the same speeds as men, they shattered that myth.</p><h2>Nordic Breakthroughs</h2><p>Women''s cross-country skiing was added in 1952, but distances were shorter than men''s events. Athletes fought for equal distances, finally achieving them in recent decades.</p><p>Champions like <a href=\"/therese-johaug-profile/\">Therese Johaug</a>, <a href=\"/frida-karlsson-profile/\">Frida Karlsson</a>, and <a href=\"/jessie-diggins-profile/\">Jessie Diggins</a> have shown women can compete at extraordinary levels of endurance.</p><h2>The Ski Jumping Fight</h2><p>Women''s ski jumping faced the longest battle for recognition. Despite petitions and protests, women were excluded from Winter Games ski jumping until 2014. <a href=\"/maren-lundby-profile/\">Maren Lundby</a> and other pioneers fought for decades before women could compete on the world''s biggest stage.</p><p>Today, athletes like <a href=\"/nika-prevc-profile/\">Nika Prevc</a> continue pushing the sport forward.</p><h2>Biathlon Champions</h2><p>Women''s biathlon joined the Games in 1992. Athletes like Magdalena Forsberg, Tora Berger, and modern stars like <a href=\"/lisa-vittozzi-profile/\">Lisa Vittozzi</a>, <a href=\"/dorothea-wierer-profile/\">Dorothea Wierer</a>, and <a href=\"/elvira-oeberg-profile/\">Elvira Öberg</a> have made women''s biathlon one of the most watched winter sports.</p><h2>Speed and Power</h2><p>In alpine skiing, athletes like <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> have rewritten record books. <a href=\"/sofia-goggia-profile/\">Sofia Goggia</a> and <a href=\"/lara-gut-behrami-profile/\">Lara Gut-Behrami</a> demonstrate that women can race downhill with fearless aggression.</p><h2>Ongoing Challenges</h2><p>Despite progress, disparities remain. Prize money, media coverage, and sponsorship still favor men in many sports. Nordic combined still lacks women''s events at the Games. The fight for true equality continues.</p><p>Each generation of women athletes builds on the sacrifices of those who came before, pushing winter sports closer to genuine equality.</p>", "de": "<p>Die Geschichte der Frauen im Wintersport ist eine Geschichte der Entschlossenheit gegen Diskriminierung. Jahrzehntelang wurde Frauen gesagt, bestimmte Sportarten seien zu gefährlich oder unangemessen für sie.</p><h2>Frühe Pionierinnen</h2><p>In den frühen 1900ern mussten Frauen, die Ski fahren wollten, für das Privileg kämpfen.</p><h2>Skisprung-Kampf</h2><p>Das Damen-Skispringen hatte den längsten Kampf um Anerkennung. <a href=\"/maren-lundby-profile/\">Maren Lundby</a> und andere Pionierinnen kämpften jahrzehntelang.</p><h2>Geschwindigkeit und Kraft</h2><p>Athletinnen wie <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> haben Rekordbücher umgeschrieben.</p>", "fr": "<p>L''histoire des femmes dans les sports d''hiver est une histoire de détermination contre la discrimination. Pendant des décennies, on a dit aux femmes que certains sports étaient trop dangereux pour elles.</p><h2>Premières pionnières</h2><p>Au début des années 1900, les femmes qui voulaient skier devaient se battre pour ce privilège.</p><h2>Le combat du saut à ski</h2><p>Le saut à ski féminin a connu la plus longue bataille pour la reconnaissance. <a href=\"/maren-lundby-profile/\">Maren Lundby</a> et d''autres pionnières ont lutté pendant des décennies.</p><h2>Vitesse et puissance</h2><p>Des athlètes comme <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> ont réécrit les livres de records.</p>", "it": "<p>La storia delle donne negli sport invernali è una storia di determinazione contro la discriminazione. Per decenni, alle donne è stato detto che certi sport erano troppo pericolosi per loro.</p><h2>Prime pioniere</h2><p>All''inizio del 1900, le donne che volevano sciare dovevano lottare per il privilegio.</p><h2>La lotta del salto con gli sci</h2><p>Il salto con gli sci femminile ha affrontato la battaglia più lunga per il riconoscimento. <a href=\"/maren-lundby-profile/\">Maren Lundby</a> e altre pioniere hanno lottato per decenni.</p>", "es": "<p>La historia de las mujeres en los deportes de invierno es una historia de determinación contra la discriminación.</p><h2>Primeras pioneras</h2><p>A principios de 1900, las mujeres que querían esquiar tuvieron que luchar por el privilegio.</p>", "pt": "<p>A história das mulheres nos esportes de inverno é uma história de determinação contra a discriminação.</p><h2>Primeiras pioneiras</h2><p>No início de 1900, as mulheres que queriam esquiar tiveram que lutar pelo privilégio.</p>", "nl": "<p>De geschiedenis van vrouwen in de wintersport is een verhaal van vastberadenheid tegen discriminatie.</p><h2>Vroege pioniers</h2><p>In het begin van de 20e eeuw moesten vrouwen die wilden skiën vechten voor dat voorrecht.</p>", "ar": "<p>تاريخ النساء في الرياضات الشتوية هو قصة عزيمة ضد التمييز. لعقود، قيل للنساء أن بعض الرياضات خطيرة جداً بالنسبة لهن.</p><h2>الرائدات الأوائل</h2><p>في أوائل القرن العشرين، كان على النساء اللواتي أردن التزلج أن يكافحن من أجل هذا الامتياز.</p>", "ja": "<p>ウィンタースポーツにおける女性の歴史は、差別に対する決意の物語です。何十年もの間、女性たちは特定のスポーツは危険すぎると言われてきました。</p><h2>初期のパイオニア</h2><p>1900年代初頭、スキーをしたい女性たちはその特権のために戦わなければなりませんでした。</p>", "zh": "<p>Nvxing zai dongji yundong zhong de lishi shi yige dui kangqishi de juexin gushi. Shu shi nian lai, nvxing bei gaozhiren moxie yundong tai weixian.</p><h2>Zaoqi xianqu</h2><p>Zai 20 shiji chu, xiang huaxue de nvxing bixu wei zhezhong tequan er fendou.</p>", "ko": "<p>동계 스포츠에서 여성의 역사는 차별에 맞선 결단력의 이야기입니다. 수십 년 동안 여성들은 특정 스포츠가 너무 위험하다는 말을 들어왔습니다.</p><h2>초기 선구자들</h2><p>1900년대 초, 스키를 타고 싶었던 여성들은 그 특권을 위해 싸워야 했습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    NULL,
    '{"en": "Women in winter sports history - From banned competitions to record-breaking achievements, discover the pioneers who fought for equality on snow and ice.", "de": "Frauen in der Wintersportgeschichte - Von verbotenen Wettkämpfen bis zu rekordverdächtigen Leistungen.", "fr": "Les femmes dans l''histoire des sports d''hiver - Des compétitions interdites aux exploits record.", "it": "Le donne nella storia degli sport invernali - Dalle competizioni vietate ai record.", "es": "Mujeres en la historia de los deportes de invierno - De competiciones prohibidas a logros récord.", "pt": "Mulheres na história dos esportes de inverno - De competições proibidas a conquistas recordes.", "nl": "Vrouwen in de wintersportgeschiedenis - Van verboden wedstrijden tot recordprestaties.", "ar": "النساء في تاريخ الرياضات الشتوية - من المسابقات المحظورة إلى الإنجازات القياسية", "ja": "ウィンタースポーツにおける女性の歴史 - 禁止された競技から記録破りの達成まで", "zh": "Nvxing dongji yundong lishi - Cong bei jinzhi de bisai dao pojihu de chengjiu", "ko": "동계 스포츠 여성의 역사 - 금지된 대회에서 기록적인 업적까지"}'::jsonb,
    'published',
